<title>EGYPT: MIGOP makes $2.5 mln pounds Q1 profit. [Corrected 09:12 gmt]</title>
<headline>MIGOP makes $2.5 mln pounds Q1 profit. [Corrected 09:12 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the first three months</p>
<p>of calendar 1997, the company's financial year.</p>
<p>(All figures in Egyptian pounds, no comparative figures available)</p>
<p>					   Jan97-March97</p>
<p>(Corrects from Jan96 to Jan97)</p>
<p> Net sales				 79,889,950</p>
<p> Production costs			 63,856,637</p>
<p> Overheads				   7,867,642</p>
<p> Exceptional revenues		     482,588</p>
<p> Exceptional expenditure		  168,477</p>
<p> Net profit before tax		  8,479,782</p>
<p>Full company name is Misr Gulf Oil Processing.</p>
<p>$1 =3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
